            "captions": {
                "instagram": "Staying vs. growing—here's a truth nobody talks about. Real reflection doesn't push you forward OR hold you back. It just complicates things by turning your autopilots into conscious decisions. Suddenly you see YOURSELF in situations you used to blame others for. So now what?\n\nI've learned to tell the difference between productive rumination (\"what am I learning?\") and toxic dwelling (\"why is everyone happier?\"). One builds insight. The Other builds therapy bills.\n\nChange isn't some heroic 2AM tweet. Sometimes you just gotta sit with discomfort before anything meaningful shifts. 🍕\n\nThis idea lives deeper in \"The Nine Stitches\" → \n\n#TheNineStitches #ThoughtfulLiving #PhilosophyDaily #DailyPhilosophy",
                "linkedin": "[Caption generation failed: 'NoneType' object has no attribute 'strip']",
                "pinterest": "I’ve spent enough time deep-thinking on the paradox: the pressure to \"level up\" versus the comfort of just staying put. Real self-reflection makes things complicated! Stop confusing productive rumination with just dwelling. Recognize which loop you's spinning. If you're ambitious, take one small step. Or order pizza.\n\nKeep this close for the days you need it.\n\n#TheNineStitches #ExistentialThoughts #PhilosophyDaily #DeepThoughtsDaily",
                "youtube": "When you find yourself stuck between growing and staying, remember: not all movement is progress, and not all stillness is stagnation. The key is knowing which loop you're in. 🧵\n\n[178 characters]\n\nSave this for later.\n\n#TheNineStitches #InnerWorkJourney #PhilosophyDaily #LifePhilosophy",
                "threads": "[Caption generation failed: 'NoneType' object has no attribute 'strip']\n\nWant to read more?... check out my LinkedIn",
                "bluesky": "[Caption generation failed: 'NoneType' object has no attribute 'strip']\n\nWant to read more?... check out my LinkedIn"
            },
